  "steps": [
    "Melt the butter with the oil in a large, wide pot over medium heat and add the sliced onions.",
    "Cook the onions 10 to 15 minutes, stirring often and adding a splash of water whenever the bottom browns, until deep golden brown.",
    "Add the pancetta and cook until crisp.",
    "Stir in the garlic for 30 seconds.",
    "Deglaze with the white wine, then add the salt, thyme and rosemary.",
    "Add the dry pasta and the beef broth and simmer, stirring often, until the pasta is tender and most of the liquid is absorbed.",
    "Stir in the cream and parmesan until creamy.",
    "Top with the gruyère and let it melt, covered or under the broiler, then serve."
  ],
